<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span id="m_039"></span>ITEM
16C. PRINCIPAL ACCOUNTANT FEES AND SERVICES</b></span></p>

