5 - <span id="xdx_827_zfXEYrnqMmVh">FIXED ASSETS, NET</span></span></p>




<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-01to2022-12-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock"><p id="xdx_897_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock_zCx9V1MU5vo" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B1_zTCrLN6jTNak" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF FIXED ASSETS, NET</span></span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: 0.5in; border-collapse: collapse; width: 80%">
