net proceeds of approximately $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock_pn3n3_c20201229__20201230__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--DirectOfferingMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--AmericanDepositorySharesMember_zssUQcLuXPq9" title="Net proceeds after deducting closing costs and fees"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" contextRef="From2020-12-292020-12-30_custom_AmericanDepositorySharesMember_custom_DirectOfferingMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">24,026</ix:nonFraction></span>, net of issuance expenses.</span></p>

