fair value of options granted during the year ended December 31, 2022, was $ <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_pid_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--EmployeeStockMember_zC3uJjUzD4of" title="Weighted average fair value of options granted" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE9QVElPTiBBQ1RJVklUWSAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_us-gaap_EmployeeStockMember59053953" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.08</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.</span></td>
</tr></table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A2_zROxEDTcsNU5" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 74.85pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


