$<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--SeniorOfficersThreeMember_zG84JuIx8cTc" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_SeniorOfficersThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.38</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date) for the last third of the options. <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200608__20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeSeniorOfficersMember_zfwubCgCybLk" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-06-082020-06-09_custom_ThreeSeniorOfficersMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company
