<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">On
July 16, 2020, the Company&#8217;s shareholders approved, among others, a grant of options to two members of the Company&#8217;s Board
of Directors, to the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and to the Company&#8217;s Vice President of Human Resources to purchase
<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200715__20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--BoardOfDirectorsOneMember_zWBb5CPdsL3l" title="Number of options purchased"><span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200715__20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--BoardOfDirectorsTwoMember_z6WLZDxalCke" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-07-152020-07-16_custom_BoardOfDirectorsOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-07-152020-07-16_custom_BoardOfDirectorsTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">300,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> each, <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200715__20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_zXT2K2KeyhUf" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-07-152020-07-16_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,113,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, and <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200715__20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--VicePresidentMember_zd59EymtZBA5" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-07-152020-07-16_srt_VicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">700,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, of the Company&#8217;s Ordinary Shares at an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentOneMember_z6bYdahSyRYa" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-07-16_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">0.787</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately
$<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentOneMember_zVOAvBrmXCZh" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.23</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date) for one third of the options, an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentTwoMember_zx7UsQtKnqNc" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.06</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentTwoMember_zxSC6R6nGZbd" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.31</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the
grant date) for the second third of the options and an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentThreeMember_zLfE2UFSk9bh" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.33</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200609__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zfiFJUciPGsd" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-06-09_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.38</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date) for
the last third of the options. <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200715__20200716__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zUl209N3zvP6" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-07-152020-07-16_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested on December 31, 2022</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company recorded in its
2020 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zZWHvekCIfN4" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_TwoBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">292</ix:nonFraction></span>, in respect of such grants, included in general and administrative expenses.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 19, 2020, the Company granted to its Vice President of Operations options to purchase an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200818__20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--VicePresidentMember_zJGXeRMRAoS1" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-08-182020-08-19_srt_VicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">700,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares,
