NIS <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--VicePresidentTwoMember_znWu3GF4Poo7" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-08-19_custom_VicePresidentTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.06</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--VicePresidentTwoMember_z0oOcAxXsJ1h" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-08-19_custom_VicePresidentTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.31</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date) for the second third of the options and an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--VicePresidentThreeMember_zIkD4VpmNNlk" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-08-19_custom_VicePresidentThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.33</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately
$<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--VicePresidentThreeMember_zI0ci4fK53ng" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-08-19_custom_VicePresidentThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.38</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date) for the last third of the options. <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200818__20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--VicePresidentMember_zziaeD407vi3" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-08-182020-08-19_srt_VicePresidentMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested on June 30,
2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company recorded in its 2020 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--VicePresidentMember__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--ResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseMember_zFZ2aTy5lic8" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_srt_VicePresidentMember_us-gaap_ResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">11</ix:nonFraction></span>, in respect of such grant, included in research
