<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">During
2020, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_z7gq53gShvH2" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price ranging between NIS <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_z4D5gOtcpul" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">0.787</ix:nonFraction></span>
to NIS <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zZjz6ncABe7i" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.95</ix:nonFraction></span> (an average of approximately $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_z1Ea2clMjjwg" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.46</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date). <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_z9OKC1eKy4J1" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">One third of the options vest after one year and the balance
of the remaining options vest over eight quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>. In addition, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zvcQTx7R6jYb" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,815,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price ranging between NIS <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zDeyN0anUJI6" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">0.787</ix:nonFraction></span> to NIS <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zdQ9wM9sEDRf" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.95</ix:nonFraction></span> (an average of approximately $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zUbQkJMa9bi2" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.36</ix:nonFraction></span> per share
at the grant date). <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zNs4g0wiGTz3" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 18, 2021, the Company approved an extension to the expiration dates, of all the options already granted under the Company&#8217;s
2016 Equity Incentive Plan, from <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20210117__20210118__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_zmKDXwop84ad" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-01-172021-01-18_custom_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">three years after each vesting date to seven years starting from the grant date</ix:nonNumeric></span>. As a result, the Company
recorded in its 2021 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_zxHRbsjD3ct9" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">815</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>


