<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">During
2021, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zSd1ujMEOdW1" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,480,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price ranging between NIS <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_z6QtEajjAkRb" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.33</ix:nonFraction></span>
to NIS <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zXCt6n7yzTS7" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">2.29</ix:nonFraction></span> (an average of approximately $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zh7Q1k6tehPb" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.74</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date). <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zD3Txm8gZdz1" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest equally over twelve quarters</ix:nonNumeric></span>. In addition,
the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zkQttnLlP5bi" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,875,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price ranging between NIS <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zIx3N0pr0RA8" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">2.29</ix:nonFraction></span> to NIS
<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zWFmxx4q3BOh" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">5.93</ix:nonFraction></span> (an average of approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uUSDPShares_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zIqktH4wqfi9" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.91</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date). <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zHvbCLqrwB84" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">One third of the options vest after one year and the balance of
the remaining options vest equally over eight quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>. <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">As a result, the Company recorded in its 2021 statement of comprehensive
loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_zgOMFZtx0tU8" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">313</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"/><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(d)</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Options
                                            granted during 2022.</b></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 23, 2022, the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors approved a reduction to the exercise price of previously granted options for 27
employees, under the Company&#8217;s 2016 Equity Incentive Plan, with an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20220523__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwentySevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zL6c9reEUwic" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-05-23_custom_TwentySevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">2.29</ix:nonFraction></span> to an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwentySevenEmployeesMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zdIRgkDE8qca" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_TwentySevenEmployeesMember_custom_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1</ix:nonFraction></span>. As
a result, the Company recorded, in its 2022 statement of comprehensive loss, an expense of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwentySevenEmployeesMember_ztUyQJcYjz9e" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_TwoThousandSixteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_custom_TwentySevenEmployeesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">39</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 18, 2022, the Company granted options to five of its senior officers to purchase an aggregate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220817__20220818__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveSeniorOfficersMember_zFvKrXJFddqd" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-08-172022-08-18_custom_FiveSeniorOfficersMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,200,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares, at
an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_pid_uILSPShare_c20220818__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveSeniorOfficersMember_zBATJAiNt555" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-08-18_custom_FiveSeniorOfficersMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20220818__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveSeniorOfficersMember_z0jZJS7Kcx7f" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-08-18_custom_FiveSeniorOfficersMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.31</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date). <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220817__20220818__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--FiveSeniorOfficersMember_zCUGnGFgVbj3" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-08-172022-08-18_custom_FiveSeniorOfficersMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested, starting
from January 1, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">On
October 20, 2022, the Company&#8217;s shareholders approved grants of options to three members of the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors,
to the Company&#8217;s Vice President of Human Resources and to the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer to purchase <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--BoardOfDirectorsOneMember_zVQIiQEUrmXh" title="Number of options purchased"><span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--BoardOfDirectorsTwoMember_zBP6gSjArvcc" title="Number of options purchased"><span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--BoardOfDirectorsThreeMember_zSZKzsc4XDd8" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_custom_BoardOfDirectorsOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_custom_BoardOfDirectorsTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_custom_BoardOfDirectorsThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">400,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span></span> each,
<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--VicePresidentMember_zAFnB5dSNZPg" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_srt_VicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_zu3Ljfg8sJw9" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, of the Company&#8217;s Ordinary Shares at an exercise price of NIS<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uILSPShare_c20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zmXvwPUle2rd" title="Option exercise price"> <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-20_custom_ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zRsL6E5j1n3e" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-10-20_custom_ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.28</ix:nonFraction></span> per share
at the grant date). <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20221019__20221020__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zwHl7xd15bKl" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-10-192022-10-20_custom_ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company recorded, in its 2022 statement of comprehensive
loss, an expense of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zcU5ap6TJfWl" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">6</ix:nonFraction></span>, with respect to such grants, included in general and administrative expenses.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">During
2022, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zn5lmQPqX0hl" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,225,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uILSPShare_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zZ7WPVwauJR5" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">2.29</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately
$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zNQQP3QpYD7e" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.72</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date), which exercise price was <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember_zgauKQSpneLa" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_ThreeBoardOfDirectorsChiefExecutiveOfficerAndVicePresidentMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">thereafter reduced to NIS 1 as described above, with some of the options
vesting equally over twelve quarters, and some of the options having a one-year cliff and the remainder vesting equally over eight quarters</ix:nonNumeric></span>.
In addition, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zK48rFUAaHyk" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">75,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uILSPShare_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zcoDQ52Kylg8" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1.95</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately
$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20220818__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zy4JVZwQKcs2" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-08-18_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.61</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date), all the <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zpkPQOMJmTbe" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">options vest on the grant date</ix:nonNumeric></span>. Furthermore, the Company granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeThreeMember_zwllk6M7tAe9" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeeThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,775,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
Ordinary Shares to its employees at an exercise price of NIS <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uILSPShare_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeThreeMember_z7v9GyRupxgf" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EmployeeThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="ILSPShare">1</ix:nonFraction></span> (approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeThreeMember_zuxAak1eDZxa" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EmployeeThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.28</ix:nonFraction></span> per share at the grant date), with <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeThreeMember_zojP5nJfeHq6" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeeThreeMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">some of the options
vesting equally over twelve quarters, and some of the options having a one-year cliff and the remainder vesting equally over eight quarters</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">As
a result, the Company recorded in its 2022 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_zKIOqEzDxAF3" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">64</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"/><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(e)</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Options
                                            granted to Eye-Net&#8217;s employees.</b></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 92.75pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 19, 2020, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Eye-Net, granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20200818__20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z1G9d8jSvuC6" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2020-08-182020-08-19_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">8,700</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares of Eye-Net to its employees
at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20200819__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_zFdMhihYDqY6" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2020-08-19_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">100</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20200818__20200819__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z8TMcJQUqq29" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-08-182020-08-19_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options vest over 12 quarters until fully vested on June 30, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company recorded in
its 2022, 2021 and 2020 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zLTZMnRRMaV4" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">115</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z6mKtRrjMJue" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">135</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20200101__20201231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z5hd9vdKlMkg" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2020-01-012020-12-31_custom_EmployeeOneMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">74</ix:nonFraction></span>, in respect of such grant.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
2021, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Eye-Net, granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z09iNREaSm7" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,850</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares of Eye-Net to its employees at an exercise
price of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20211231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_zwwVOOeLhklb" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">100</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_zOo8MIxuQMU2" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">4,500 options vest over 36 months, one third of the options vest after one year and the balance of the remaining
options vest over eight quarters until fully vested. 350 options vests over 11 quarters until fully vested</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company recorded in its
2022 and 2021 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zB2OPjBg0yJf" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">96</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20210101__20211231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_zm4nbfx7AUp9" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_EmployeeTwoMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">19</ix:nonFraction></span>, in respect of such grant.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0in; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
2022, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Eye-Net, granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_zL10PAWqeZz6" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,350</ix:nonFraction></span> ordinary shares of Eye-Net to its employees. <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeesMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_z6ZVZndNCtIh" title="Option vesting period, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EmployeesMember_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">The options
vest over 36 months, one third of the options vest after one year and the balance of the remaining options vest over eight quarters</ix:nonNumeric></span> until
fully vested. <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_zMkMS0DwvZHg" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">450</ix:nonFraction></span> options were granted at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeOneMember_zamBy0IoCSed" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">100</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_pid_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember_zg3T2B6wkpod" title="Number of options purchased"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">900</ix:nonFraction></span> options were granted at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20221231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeTwoMember_zZ7Ke5CUU9f2" title="Option exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">200</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.
The Company recorded in its 2022 statement of comprehensive loss an expense of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--EyeNetMobileLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--EmployeeThreeMember_ziaIclAFA1Hf" title="Share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_EyeNetMobileLtdMember_custom_EmployeeThreeMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">14</ix:nonFraction></span>, in respect of such grant.</span></p>

